            <ArticleTitle>Endodontic treatment of a &quot;very particular&quot; maxillary central incisor.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>560-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Maxillary central incisor teeth can vary dramatically in their external and internal anatomy. Endodontic treatment of a most unusual four-canal central incisor with resorption is described and healing is demonstrated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
